  "title": "New Era Energy & Digital Announces Appointment of Andy Casazza as Chief Corporate Officer",
  "summary": "MIDLAND, Texas – April 17, 2026 – New Era Energy Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: NUAI) (“New Era” or the “Company”), a developer and operator of next-generation digital infrastructure and integrated power assets in the Permian Basin, today announced the appointment of Andy Casazza as Chief Corporate Officer, effective April 28, 2026. The appointment reflects New Era’s continued expansion of its leadership team following the recent appointment of Ted Warner as Chief Financial Officer. Mr. Casa",
